          <option value="1">1x Ticket Wager (1 🎟️)</option>
          <option value="2">2x Ticket Wager (2 🎟️)</option>
          <option value="4">4x Ticket Wager (4 🎟️)</option>
          <option value="8">8x Ticket Wager (8 🎟️)</option>
